I didn't think you'd be awake.


00:02:29.332 --> 00:02:30.492
You have an appointment...


00:02:30.667 --> 00:02:33.261
...with Guy Morgan,
I didn't think you'd wanna be late.


00:02:33.436 --> 00:02:36.371
Oh, look at you thinking. Cute.


00:02:36.539 --> 00:02:38.598
But I always have time for my portrait.


00:02:38.775 --> 00:02:40.299
Look alive. Paint.


00:02:40.743 --> 00:02:42.574
