Guy Morgan.


00:07:01.938 --> 00:07:03.769
Could you give his son, Luke, a tour?


00:07:03.940 --> 00:07:06.807
Sure. Would you like
to see the Wellesley perks?


00:07:06.976 --> 00:07:09.604
Um, yes, brilliant. Sure.


00:07:10.580 --> 00:07:12.070
