is mad, mad drama, okay?


00:09:57.446 --> 00:09:59.846
I am talking to you
and you don't even know my name.


00:10:00.016 --> 00:10:01.916
- I'm Mickey O'Malley.
- Mickey O'Malley.


00:10:02.084 --> 00:10:03.711
A rarity in the Irish community.


00:10:04.287 --> 00:10:06.380
Om.


00:10:07.189 --> 00:10:09.817
RAVl: Om.
- Om.


00:10:09.992 --> 00:10:12.085
- Om.
- Om!


00:10:12.261 --> 00:10:14.786
This is not a contest, Ms. Gail.


00:10:15.164 --> 00:10:16.791
Just concentrate on your breathing.


00:10:18.301 --> 00:10:19.461
My butt is numb.


00:10:19.802 --> 00:10:22.999
If your butt is suffering,
then you are suffering.


00:10:23.172 --> 00:10:26.630
In fact, your entire life is suffering. Why?


00:10:26.809 --> 00:10:29.903
Because you crave
that which is meaningless.


00:10:30.079 --> 00:10:32.070
Are you calling me shallow?


00:10:33.149 --> 00:10:38.985
No, I'm saying to stop your craving
and release your butt.


00:10:39.155 --> 00:10:42.716
Just release it. Release it, yeah.
Release that butt.


00:10:43.592 --> 00:10:46.652
<i>Release that butt
Oh, yeah, release that butt</i>


00:10:46.829 --> 00:10:49.423
<i>Oh, yeah, release that butt</i>


00:10:49.598 --> 00:10:50.895
Mrs. Van Ravensway?


00:10:51.067 --> 00:10:53.592
