00:11:56.465 --> 00:11:57.489
<i>Ow.</i>


00:11:57.666 --> 00:12:00.100
<i>What are you doing?
I'm on the phone.</i>


00:12:00.269 --> 00:12:01.861
<i>- I'm cleansing.
Heh, heh.</i>


00:12:02.071 --> 00:12:04.301
Mac and cheese.


00:12:05.207 --> 00:12:08.335
<i>I don't need your spiritual counseling.</i>


00:12:08.878 --> 00:12:10.436
<i>I'm thinking of firing you.</i>


00:12:15.951 --> 00:12:19.318
Pace yourself, Ms. Gail,
