01:04:32.436 --> 01:04:33.903
How many cameras do you have?


01:04:34.071 --> 01:04:36.801
Enough to know your accent's
faker than my mom's soul.


01:04:36.974 --> 01:04:40.432
Oh, and don't get the dumb idea
to throw that Showcase.


01:04:40.611 --> 01:04:41.942
Because I talked to a lawyer.


01:04:42.112 --> 01:04:46.811
And he found a loophole that allows me
to access that money your daddy left you...


01:04:46.984 --> 01:04:49.544
...should I need it for a medical reason.


01:04:49.720 --> 01:04:52.587
<i>You know, hello, longer legs.</i>


01:04:52.756 --> 01:04:56.419
- Whoa, whoa, whoa. Before you go...
- I'll sing for Bev. Don't worry.


01:04:56.893 --> 01:04:58.918
Well, that was easier than I thought.


01:04:59.096 --> 01:05:00.961
Now, go and make me a vodka tonic.


01:05:01.131 --> 01:05:02.689
Hold the tonic.


01:05:12.409 --> 01:05:14.400
Her reign of terror's gotta stop.


01:05:14.578 --> 01:05:16.102
I'm in. What do we do?


01:05:16.280 --> 01:05:18.111
Look, there's nothing you can do.


01:05:18.782 --> 01:05:21.148
If you try to help,
it's just gonna make it worse.


01:05:21.318 --> 01:05:24.344
That woman is a demon
spawned from darkness itself.


01:05:24.521 --> 01:05:25.852
I wish she'd go straight back to...


01:05:26.023 --> 01:05:27.854
Hello, Ms. Gail.


01:05:28.025 --> 01:05:31.426
Have you, uh, released your mind
from the shackles of thinking today?


01:05:31.595 --> 01:05:33.495
- I'm working on it.
- Very good.


01:05:33.764 --> 01:05:36.494
