I hate you.


01:05:36.867 --> 01:05:39.131
Very good. You look pretty.


01:05:39.303 --> 01:05:40.998
I know.


01:05:42.673 --> 01:05:45.506
That broad
ain't getting away with ruining your life.


01:05:45.676 --> 01:05:47.337
I'm pooping in her bed tonight.


01:05:47.511 --> 01:05:50.344
Victor, I thought you hated me.


01:05:50.514 --> 01:05:51.606
Are you an idiot?


01:05:51.782 --> 01:05:53.943
You're the only person
who knows my birthday.


01:05:54.117 --> 01:05:55.982
The only one who says goodnight
to me.


01:05:56.153 --> 01:05:58.553
The only one who makes me
mac and cheese.


01:05:58.722 --> 01:06:00.917
You're annoying and ugly...


01:06:01.091 --> 01:06:02.490
...but I sort of love you.


01:06:04.928 --> 01:06:06.555
I sort of love you too.


01:06:07.164 --> 01:06:11.624
But just promise me
you're not gonna do anything, okay?


01:06:12.102 --> 01:06:13.694
- You too.
- Oh, come on.


01:06:13.870 --> 01:06:15.804
- Just... No... Ple...
- Just... No. Just...


01:06:15.972 --> 01:06:17.462
- No. Tony.
- Just one...


01:06:18.375 --> 01:06:19.706
Okay.


01:06:19.976 --> 01:06:24.379
All right.
Well, now I get to go fold Bev's delicates.


01:06:39.896 --> 01:06:43.525
- Have you heard of knocking?
- Ever heard of I don't care?


01:06:43.800 --> 01:06:45.961
Where'd you put my blue blouse?


01:06:46.136 --> 01:06:48.229
Oh, okay.


01:06:48.405 --> 01:06:50.930
Okay, which one of these
do you like better?


01:06:51.842 --> 01:06:55.744
- You actually want my opinion?
- God, I know. What's wrong with me?


01:06:56.713 --> 01:07:00.615
You know how you're a bitch and I act
like I don't care, but truth is I'm sensitive?


01:07:00.784 --> 01:07:03.309
- Actually...
- I need someone to talk to like a sister...


01:07:03.487 --> 01:07:05.387
...and you're better than nothing.


01:07:06.857 --> 01:07:11.294
I'm nervous about tonight.
Oh, my God, why did I just tell you that?


01:07:13.163 --> 01:07:15.256
I don't know.


01:07:15.599 --> 01:07:17.863
It's like my whole body is freaking out.


01:07:18.034 --> 01:07:19.126
I have hives on my butt.


01:07:19.302 --> 01:07:21.770
I can't tell Mom
and I can't talk to Luke about it.


01:07:21.938 --> 01:07:23.303
He'll say something like:


01:07:23.473 --> 01:07:26.408
"Oh, one minute
you're talented and we're connecting...


01:07:26.576 --> 01:07:29.807
...and the next minute you're self-involved
and histrionic."


01:07:29.980 --> 01:07:33.211
- What does that even mean? I hate history.
- He said that?


01:07:35.051 --> 01:07:38.919
Listen, Toadie, he's not falling for you,
he's falling for me.


01:07:39.089 --> 01:07:40.784
I just don't know who me is anymore.


01:07:40.957 --> 01:07:43.255
Why are you nervous?
You're not really singing.


01:07:43.427 --> 01:07:46.487
All you have to do is stand there
and look pretty.


01:07:48.064 --> 01:07:50.897
Have you ever thought
about how that makes me feel?


01:07:51.701 --> 01:07:53.168
You have talent.


01:07:53.336 --> 01:07:56.828
<i>You could go on American Idol
and forget about the rest of us.</i>


01:07:57.073 --> 01:07:59.405
This is, like, my only chance.


01:08:00.110 --> 01:08:01.839
Pretty doesn't last very long.


01:08:02.012 --> 01:08:03.946
Just look at Mom.


01:08:06.116 --> 01:08:07.242
You think I'm talented?


01:08:09.052 --> 01:08:11.145
If you tell anyone I said that, I'll deny it.


01:08:12.856 --> 01:08:14.380
Wear the blue blouse.


01:08:14.558 --> 01:08:16.526
It makes your eyes pop.


01:08:19.629 --> 01:08:20.857
This better work.


01:08:21.431 --> 01:08:23.661
Because if I go down,
you're go down with me.


01:08:36.646 --> 01:08:40.309
Yeah, yeah, yeah.
What's up, my party people?


01:08:40.484 --> 01:08:43.578
Yeah. All right, all right, all right.
Let's get this show started.


01:08:43.753 --> 01:08:47.746
Welcome to the stage, my boy, my British
biscuit and y'all's host for the night...


01:08:47.924 --> 01:08:50.415
...Luke Morgan.


01:08:52.996 --> 01:08:55.988
Are you amped for the Wellesley Academy
of the Arts Showcase?


01:08:57.534 --> 01:09:01.630
Good. Because we have Mickey O'Malley
spinning tonight.


01:09:05.575 --> 01:09:11.639
So let's get this party started
with Big Pain Ticket.


01:09:21.391 --> 01:09:25.157
<i>I wanna kiss your apocalypse</i>


01:09:25.328 --> 01:09:28.422
<i>Wrap you in my Armageddon</i>


01:09:28.598 --> 01:09:32.090
<i>Sing you a twisted serenade</i>


01:09:32.269 --> 01:09:35.329
<i>We can run away together</i>


01:09:45.515 --> 01:09:48.245
Hello, Guy. So glad you could make it.


01:09:48.418 --> 01:09:51.444
My two A&R guys, Tom and, uh, Tom.


01:09:52.022 --> 01:09:53.387
Uh, did I miss your big line up?


01:09:53.557 --> 01:09:57.152
