01:10:15.145 --> 01:10:17.204
What a lovely suit.


01:10:21.785 --> 01:10:22.877
Move it.


01:10:23.053 --> 01:10:25.453
Hey. Out of the way. Out of the way.
Michael, go on.


01:10:25.622 --> 01:10:27.886
