- No. No.


01:10:57.220 --> 01:11:00.087
No? No? No? Then focus!


01:11:05.595 --> 01:11:08.257
- Look, Ange, you...
- Gail's been threatening me too.


01:11:08.431 --> 01:11:10.456
That's why you're doing
what she wants.


01:11:10.800 --> 01:11:13.098
