- Ange.


01:11:13.703 --> 01:11:15.637
You're my best friend.


01:11:15.805 --> 01:11:18.239
Look, I'd do anything for you.


01:11:28.718 --> 01:11:30.549
Okay.


01:11:32.789 --> 01:11:37.317
So we're gonna take it up a notch
with Jason Berkeley and the Funky Funk.


01:11:43.166 --> 01:11:44.190
Scratch that.


01:11:44.367 --> 01:11:47.302
Um, here are my boys, the Oral Majority.


01:11:56.012 --> 01:11:58.480
<i>I'm lost in a world that rattles my brain</i>


01:11:58.648 --> 01:12:02.550
<i>Cleaning up my life
From the mess you made, oh, oh</i>


01:12:05.355 --> 01:12:06.720
Move it. Guy.


01:12:06.890 --> 01:12:11.088
This is just the boring appetizer.
The real showstopper's up next.


01:12:11.261 --> 01:12:12.728
Ah!
Oh!


01:12:12.896 --> 01:12:15.763
You okay, Mr. Morgan?
Here, let me get that for you.


01:12:17.200 --> 01:12:18.394
Well, it had better be.


01:12:18.568 --> 01:12:19.796
I have to pee.


01:12:19.969 --> 01:12:23.200
Oh, I will take you to the pee, Mr. Victor.


01:12:26.142 --> 01:12:27.973
Sorry.


01:12:28.411 --> 01:12:30.936
<i>So keep on knocking, knocking, knocking</i>


01:12:31.114 --> 01:12:36.051
<i>But, baby, you're better off walking
'Cause I ain't gonna let you in</i>


01:12:36.786 --> 01:12:38.947
<i>Never again</i>


01:12:39.122 --> 01:12:42.182
<i>No, not again</i>


01:12:42.358 --> 01:12:44.724
<i>Never again</i>


01:12:44.894 --> 01:12:48.227
<i>No, not again</i>


01:12:53.036 --> 01:12:54.367
My brothers, yeah!


01:12:54.537 --> 01:12:55.936
Okay.


01:12:56.272 --> 01:12:58.433
You guys having a good time?


01:12:59.008 --> 01:13:03.411
Let's keep it going
with Beverly Van Ravensway.


01:13:15.525 --> 01:13:17.755
<i>Plug in the mike</i>


01:13:17.927 --> 01:13:19.224
