Anything, anything, anything</i>


01:14:01.404 --> 01:14:05.807
<i>I'll make you believe in me</i>


01:14:05.975 --> 01:14:07.442
<i>I can be what you want...</i>


01:14:11.314 --> 01:14:12.338
Give me...


01:14:19.022 --> 01:14:23.118
I'm so sorry, my mike...
My mike isn't working.


01:14:23.526 --> 01:14:26.017
Uh, excuse me.


01:14:28.898 --> 01:14:31.025
<i>I don't know.
- Give me that. Give me that.</i>


01:14:36.239 --> 01:14:40.471
