01:16:34.657 --> 01:16:37.125
<i>Tonight is the night where I make you see</i>


01:16:37.293 --> 01:16:41.195
<i>That I can be
Anything, anything, anything</i>


01:16:41.364 --> 01:16:43.457
<i>You want from me</i>


01:16:49.906 --> 01:16:51.703
That's what I'm talking about.


01:16:53.543 --> 01:16:56.034
Shut the power down. Shut it down.


01:16:59.182 --> 01:17:01.582
Not so fast, jerknuts.


01:17:04.887 --> 01:17:06.252
Hey. Clear.


01:17:09.359 --> 01:17:11.759
<i>Sing something else.
We want more! We want more!</i>


01:17:11.928 --> 01:17:13.225
Like what?


01:17:13.496 --> 01:17:15.361
The demo you snuck my dad. I heard it.


01:17:15.531 --> 01:17:17.328
Yeah, do it!
Do it!


01:17:17.500 --> 01:17:22.870
<i>We want more!
We want more! We want more!</i>


01:17:25.641 --> 01:17:27.609
Okay, follow my lead, guys.


01:17:35.318 --> 01:17:39.311
<i>There's a little secret
I would like to tell you</i>


01:17:42.425 --> 01:17:47.055
<i>There's a book of lies
I know they'll try to sell you</i>


01:17:48.297 --> 01:17:51.858
<i>And they'll try and they'll try
To convince you to buy</i>


01:17:52.035 --> 01:17:53.525
<i>You need them</i>


01:17:55.505 --> 01:17:58.941
<i>So the next time you're down
Look inside, not around</i>


01:17:59.108 --> 01:18:02.271
<i>I can dress myself</i>


01:18:02.445 --> 01:18:05.380
<i>There's no need for someone's help</i>


01:18:05.548 --> 01:18:07.175
<i>There's no one to blame</i>


01:18:07.350 --> 01:18:13.084
