01:18:13.256 --> 01:18:16.555
<i>I can justify</i>


01:18:16.726 --> 01:18:19.695
<i>All the mistakes in my life</i>


01:18:19.862 --> 01:18:23.059
<i>It's taught me to be
It's given to me</i>


01:18:23.232 --> 01:18:25.632
<i>And I'll survive</i>


01:18:25.802 --> 01:18:28.930
<i>'Cause I have blessed myself</i>


01:18:30.406 --> 01:18:37.278
<i>Do you ever wonder
How anything can make you cry?</i>


01:18:37.447 --> 01:18:41.110
<i>Have yourself discover</i>


01:18:41.284 --> 01:18:48.281
<i>That the pain you feel
Is the pain that you deny</i>


01:18:48.458 --> 01:18:51.723
<i>You can bless yourself</i>


01:18:51.894 --> 01:18:54.795
<i>There's no need for someone else</i>


01:18:54.964 --> 01:19:02.393
<i>There's no one to blame
There's no one to save you but yourself</i>


01:19:02.572 --> 01:19:05.769
<i>I can justify</i>


01:19:05.942 --> 01:19:08.911
<i>All the mistakes in my life</i>


01:19:09.078 --> 01:19:12.172
<i>It's taught me to be
It's given to me</i>


01:19:12.348 --> 01:19:14.839
<i>And I'll survive</i>


01:19:15.017 --> 01:19:17.747
<i>'Cause I have blessed myself</i>


01:19:35.271 --> 01:19:36.932
Thank you, ladies and gentlemen.


01:19:37.106 --> 01:19:40.507
