Academy of Arts Showcase.


01:19:40.676 --> 01:19:43.236
Oh, my God, you were so good.


01:19:43.613 --> 01:19:45.945
Who are you?
You're like a freaking rock star.


01:19:46.115 --> 01:19:48.208
Are you kidding me? Man, she likes you...


01:19:59.428 --> 01:20:02.363
So, what did he say? Is he mad?


01:20:02.532 --> 01:20:04.193
Yeah. He's pretty ticked off...


01:20:04.367 --> 01:20:08.133
...that I'm not already making
the next big album for Kensington Records.


01:20:10.106 --> 01:20:11.869
Oh. Which album?


01:20:12.775 --> 01:20:13.799
Your album.


01:20:15.478 --> 01:20:17.469
- Are you kidding me?
- No.


01:20:19.081 --> 01:20:21.549
- You're... You're serious?
- Uh-huh.


01:20:23.786 --> 01:20:25.117
Go for it.


01:20:25.288 --> 01:20:28.052
We're making an album.
And we're writing it together.


01:20:28.224 --> 01:20:30.283
Yeah! Yeah!
I'm so happy.


01:20:30.459 --> 01:20:32.256
You know, I sing too.


01:20:32.428 --> 01:20:36.057
I can do a whole monologue album.
Incredible. Hey, congratulations.


01:20:36.232 --> 01:20:40.760
- Yo, blow it up. Boom.
I'm your boy. Call me up.


01:20:40.937 --> 01:20:44.338
Yeah. Yeah, he's really good
