- Well, everyone lies in this business.


01:21:04.493 --> 01:21:05.517
It's called spin.


01:21:06.162 --> 01:21:07.527
So Bev can't sing.


01:21:07.697 --> 01:21:09.426
That didn't stop Jessica Simpson.


01:21:09.599 --> 01:21:13.194
Well, we'll see what the school board
