01:21:20.676 --> 01:21:22.143
Guy!


01:21:23.479 --> 01:21:27.142
I will have my nirvana moment.


01:21:27.383 --> 01:21:31.149
<i>I'll make you believe in me</i>


01:21:32.622 --> 01:21:35.682
<i>I can be what you want me to be</i>


01:21:35.858 --> 01:21:38.452
Oh, come on. Look alive, people.
I'm a star.


01:21:38.628 --> 01:21:40.186
Let's try this again.


01:21:40.396 --> 01:21:42.261
<i>I'll make you believe...</i>


01:21:43.833 --> 01:21:46.563
Oh, no. You want a piece of me?


01:22:12.228 --> 01:22:14.458
Hey. Clear.


01:22:30.146 --> 01:22:32.307
<i>Run this town tonight</i>


01:22:32.481 --> 01:22:34.847
Where's breakfast...? Sorry.


01:23:16.726 --> 01:23:19.320
<i>I'm lost in a world
That rattles my brain</i>


01:23:19.495 --> 01:23:22.362
<i>I'm cleaning up my life
From the mess you made, oh, oh</i>


01:23:27.336 --> 01:23:30.863
- Katie, are you wearing a doormat?
- Welcome.


01:23:37.313 --> 01:23:39.372
Thanks. Now the pants.


01:23:44.553 --> 01:23:48.853
And then it would just take you somewhere
that you never expected you would go.


01:23:53.295 --> 01:23:56.287
<i>You wanna hear
the monologue from My Fair Lady?</i>


01:23:56.465 --> 01:23:58.592
Oy, mate, oy.


01:24:18.087 --> 01:24:19.952
I love my life.


01:24:20.122 --> 01:24:22.317
<i>Call me.
- Hello?</i>


01:24:44.780 --> 01:24:47.977
<i>Yeah. You like it? You like it? Yeah.</i>

